@startuml
participant "Control Studio" as Studio
participant "Viewer signal handler" as Handler
participant "Compiled metadata + session identity" as Identity
participant "One bounded inspection watch" as Watch
participant "Native end-of-scan publisher" as Scan
participant "Actual variable storage + I/O image" as Storage
participant "Bounded recording registry" as Records
Studio -> Handler: inspect(loop revision, exact typed selectors)
Handler -> Identity: Validate program/bindings
Handler -> Watch: Replace watch by exact identity
Watch --> Studio: pending until actual scan
Scan -> Storage: Read selected fields and addresses coherently
Scan -> Watch: Numeric values, type/missing/force quality, timestamp
Watch --> Studio: Genuine scan and exact selectors
Studio -> Records: start(selectors, inspected program revision)
loop Actual runtime scans
Scan -> Records: Same coherent selected values and per-channel quality
end
Studio -> Records: stop(recording identity)
Records --> Studio: Scan coverage + separately qualified channels
Identity -> Watch: Invalidate on reattach/restart/bytecode reload
Identity -> Records: Interrupt retained old-program evidence
@enduml
